    "statementHTML": "<div class=\"statement-body\">\n<div class=\"statement-section statement-goal\">\n   <h2><span class=\"icon icon-goal\">&nbsp;</span><span>Goal </span></h2>\n   <span class=\"question-statement\">A caterpillar eats <var>word</var>, one letter at a time, starting at its <strong>left end</strong>. Each eaten letter is removed.<br><br><strong>After eating a vowel</strong>, it switches to the other end of the remaining word. After eating a consonant, it keeps eating from the same end.<br><br>The vowels are <const>a</const>, <const>e</const>, <const>i</const>, <const>o</const> and <const>u</const>. Every other letter, including <const>y</const>, is a consonant.<br><br>Print all letters in the order they are eaten.</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"statement-section statement-protocol\">\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Input</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-input\"><strong>Line 1:</strong> A string <var>word</var> containing only lowercase English letters, with no spaces.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Output</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-output\"><strong>Line 1:</strong> All letters of <var>word</var> in eating order, with no spaces.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Constraints</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-constraints\"><const>1</const> &lt;= length of <var>word</var> &lt;= <const>200</const><br><var>word</var> contains only letters from <const>a</const> to <const>z</const>.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Example</div>\n      <div class=\"statement-inout\">\n         <div class=\"statement-inout-in\">\n            <div class=\"title\">Input</div>\n            <pre class=\"question-statement-example-in\">bcadfeg</pre>\n         </div>\n         <div class=\"statement-inout-out\">\n            <div class=\"title\">Output</div>\n            <pre class=\"question-statement-example-out\">bcagedf</pre>\n         </div>\n      </div>\n   </div>\n</div>"
